abstract: >-
  Typst sources of the textbook Computational Études: A Spectral Approach, a pedagogical course on spectral methods
  for differential equations in 21 chapters, from Fourier series and Chebyshev points to boundary and eigenvalue
  problems, time stepping and unbounded domains. Each chapter is a short study of one idea, and its codes in Python,
  MATLAB and Julia compute the figures and results of the book.
